        <div class="dokan-form-group">
            <label class="dokan-w3 dokan-control-label">Biography</label>
            <div class="dokan-w7 dokan-text-left">
                <div id="wp-vendor_biography-wrap" class="wp-core-ui wp-editor-wrap tmce-active"><div id="wp-vendor_biography-editor-tools" class="wp-editor-tools hide-if-no-js"><div id="wp-vendor_biography-media-buttons" class="wp-media-buttons"><button type="button" id="insert-media-button" class="button insert-media add_media" data-editor="vendor_biography" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="wp-media-modal"><span class="wp-media-buttons-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> Add Media</button></div>
<div class="wp-editor-tabs"></div>
</div>
<div id="wp-vendor_biography-editor-container" class="wp-editor-container"><textarea class="wp-editor-area" rows="20" autocomplete="off" cols="40" name="vendor_biography" id="vendor_biography">&lt;p data-start="89" data-end="246"&gt;ZZMORE Open Market is a dynamic online marketplace bringing together products from trusted African store owners across the UK — all in one convenient place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="248" data-end="619"&gt;We connect customers to a wide range of authentic African groceries, essentials, and lifestyle products, carefully sourced by independent retailers who understand the value of quality and cultural authenticity. By uniting multiple store owners on one platform, we make it easier for communities to access the products they love, while supporting local African businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="621" data-end="779"&gt;Our mission is simple: create a seamless shopping experience that celebrates culture, empowers retailers, and delivers convenience to customers across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="781" data-end="885"&gt;At ZZMORE Open Market, you’re not just shopping — you’re supporting a network of African entrepreneurs.&lt;/p&gt;</textarea></div>
</div>

            </div>
